modal learning, autonomous agents, and super alignment in the context of reasoning. By discussing these future research directions, we hope to inspire researchers in their exploration of this field, stimulate further advancements in reasoning with foundation models, and contribute to the development of AGI."}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4390136243", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2312.11562", "title": "A Survey of Reasoning with Foundation Models", "publication_year": 2023, "type": "preprint", "cited_by_count": 3, "open_access": {"is_oa": true, "oa_status": "green", "oa_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2312.11562", "any_repository_has_fulltext": true}, "primary_location": {"id": "pmh:oai:arXiv.org:2312.11562", "doi": null, "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11562", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2312.11562", "source": {"id": "h

